"<br> Golyga hyn na fydd derbynwyr yn gallu gwirio'ch llofnod."

#: kmcomposewin.cpp:3254
msgid ""
"The CA certificate of the certificate you want to use for signing expires "
"today."
"<br>"
"This means that beginning from tomorrow, the recipients will not be able to "
